{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02002",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.69,
      "end_seconds": 7.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "Erm, doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.2,
      "end_seconds": 12.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "So, come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.18,
      "end_seconds": 19.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Well, I've been having attacks of spinning lasting hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.78,
      "end_seconds": 21.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.57,
      "end_seconds": 26.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Probably about a week. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.57,
      "end_seconds": 37.37,
      "duration_seconds": 10.8,
      "text": "Sure. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.31,
      "end_seconds": 63.93,
      "duration_seconds": 24.62,
      "text": "It feels moderate to me. It's every other day. It settles a little with lying still. Oh, and a full feeling in the ear. That's been about the same, two days. Actually, and hearing getting worse as well, since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.45,
      "end_seconds": 69.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "So, can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.53,
      "end_seconds": 76.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "It's alendronate, 70 milligrams, maybe, once a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.68,
      "end_seconds": 81.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.97,
      "end_seconds": 87.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Erm, um, no, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.77,
      "end_seconds": 99.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.09,
      "end_seconds": 107.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "Oh, you know, yes, I had my septum straightened, in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.28,
      "end_seconds": 113.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.87,
      "end_seconds": 125.04,
      "duration_seconds": 10.17,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning. My partner and our baby. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.45,
      "end_seconds": 143.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.03,
      "end_seconds": 151.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Mm, I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.22,
      "end_seconds": 156.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.11,
      "end_seconds": 159.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.68,
      "end_seconds": 164.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.13,
      "end_seconds": 171.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Erm, I have thin bones, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.82,
      "end_seconds": 182.4,
      "duration_seconds": 10.58,
      "text": "Sure. Right, so thin bones is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Any headache, double vision or ear discharge at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.86,
      "end_seconds": 190.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "So, uh, I haven't had headache, double vision or ear discharge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.93,
      "end_seconds": 194.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Right, has there been any weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.09,
      "end_seconds": 200.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Um, no, I haven't had any weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.24,
      "end_seconds": 204.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.85,
      "end_seconds": 210.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.97,
      "end_seconds": 213.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.64,
      "end_seconds": 216.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.67,
      "end_seconds": 222.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.62,
      "end_seconds": 232.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.54,
      "end_seconds": 255.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 65, BP is 127 over 82, temperature 36.8."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.06,
      "end_seconds": 259.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Oh, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.61,
      "end_seconds": 264.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.78,
      "end_seconds": 269.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.38,
      "end_seconds": 273.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.84,
      "end_seconds": 288.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "The ear drums look normal and the hearing is reduced on the left."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.13,
      "end_seconds": 293.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.57,
      "end_seconds": 316.68,
      "duration_seconds": 16.11,
      "text": "Putting it all together, it points towards Meniere's disease. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had attacks of spinning lasting hours for about a week, moderate, and no weakness or double vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.16,
      "end_seconds": 322.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.11,
      "end_seconds": 330.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "A hearing test is what I'd like next, for vertigo and hearing loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.21,
      "end_seconds": 332.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.59,
      "end_seconds": 341.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "I'll start you on betahistine, 16 milligrams, three times a day, long term. That's for vertigo."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.25,
      "end_seconds": 345.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Is that safe with my other medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.67,
      "end_seconds": 370.43,
      "duration_seconds": 22.76,
      "text": "Cut down on salt and caffeine. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Come back in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 372.01,
      "end_seconds": 375.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Okay, uh, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 377.32,
      "end_seconds": 380.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.58,
      "end_seconds": 384.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}